Error [E0113]: `transform` promises to return [Int], but this returns `Iter`<Int>
  --> tests/ui/effect_callback_bound.jet:5:18
    |
  5 |     return items.map((x) => f(x))
    |                  ^^^
 Why: the value handed back must match the type after `->`
 Fix: use [Int] here

Error [E0747]: this callback uses the effect `Io`, which the parameter doesn't allow
  --> tests/ui/effect_callback_bound.jet:14:28
    |
 14 |     r :: transform([1, 2], noisy)
    |                            ^^^^^
 Why: the parameter is `fn(…) --[]->`, so the callback must be pure; `Io` is outside that bound
 Fix: pass a `fn(…) --[]->` callback (or a lambda that uses no effects), or widen the parameter's bound
